## Review Notes

- **Composition note:** This page is a recipe gallery, not a standalone exported component. Each card combines `TxAvatar`, `TxCornerOverlay`, `TxOutlineBorder`, `TxIcon`, and local CSS utilities; copy the smallest needed pattern instead of importing the gallery demo.
- **Accessibility note:** Purely decorative badges use empty `alt` or `aria-hidden` in the demo. If a badge changes user state, expose that state in adjacent text or the parent control label rather than relying on color or icon shape alone.
- **Verified coverage:** The demo registry loads `AvatarVariantsAvatarVariantsGalleryDemo`; the underlying component tests are `avatar.test.ts` for `TxAvatar`/`TxAvatarGroup`, plus the relevant `corner-overlay` and `outline-border` component tests for overlay placement and ring/mask behavior.

## Source

- Demo source: `apps/nexus/app/components/content/demos/AvatarVariantsAvatarVariantsGalleryDemo.vue`.
- Helper source: `apps/nexus/app/components/content/demos/AvatarVariantCard.vue`.
- Component sources: `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/avatar/src/TxAvatar.vue`, `TxAvatarGroup.vue`, plus the documented `corner-overlay` and `outline-border` primitives used by the recipes.
- Types: `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/avatar/src/types.ts` exports `AvatarProps`, `AvatarGroupProps`, `AvatarSize`, `AvatarStatus`, and `AvatarShape`.
- Coverage: `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/avatar/__tests__/avatar.test.ts` verifies initials, image fallback, slots, custom size, click emission, and group overflow count; `apps/nexus/app/components/content/demo-lazy.test.ts` verifies lazy demo loading.

